    "segments": [
      { "id": 1, "seq": 1, "source_text": "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife.", "translated_text": "凡是有钱的单身汉，总想娶位太太，这已经成了一条举世公认的真理。", "is_failed": false },
      { "id": 2, "seq": 2, "source_text": "However little known the feelings or views of such a man may be on his first entering a neighbourhood, this truth is so well fixed in the minds of the surrounding families, that he is considered as the rightful property of some one or other of their daughters.", "translated_text": "不管这样一个人的心情或见解在初进一个地区时多么不为人所知，这条真理却总是牢牢记在周围各家各户的心里，他被看作是他们某位女儿的准财产。", "is_failed": false },
      { "id": 3, "seq": 3, "source_text": "My dear Mr. Bennet, said his lady to him one day, have you heard that Netherfield Park is let at last?", "translated_text": null, "is_failed": true },
      { "id": 4, "seq": 4, "source_text": "Mr. Bennet replied that he had not.", "translated_text": "班纳特先生回答说他还没有听说。", "is_failed": false }
    ]
